      "match_notes": "<p>Following&nbsp;a&nbsp;blow&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;helmet,&nbsp;Harry&nbsp;Cole&nbsp;was&nbsp;unable&nbsp;to&nbsp;continue&nbsp;his&nbsp;innings&nbsp;or&nbsp;to&nbsp;keep&nbsp;wicket&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;second&nbsp;innings.&nbsp;Adam&nbsp;Kelly&nbsp;kept&nbsp;wicket&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;concussion&nbsp;substitute.&nbsp;I&nbsp;have&nbsp;been&nbsp;able&nbsp;to&nbsp;add&nbsp;Adam&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;scorecard,&nbsp;which&nbsp;means&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;dismissal&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mohammed&nbsp;Nazir,&nbsp;which&nbsp;should&nbsp;read&nbsp;caught&nbsp;Adam&nbsp;Kelly&nbsp;(wkt)&nbsp;bowled&nbsp;Matthew&nbsp;Kelly,&nbsp;records&nbsp;the&nbsp;dismissal&nbsp;as&nbsp;caught&nbsp;&quot;sub&quot;.</p>\r\n",
